ork too much  we saw the value of what he was doing  covet 19  is also keeping the levano's family and  their restaurants on high alert  at their westchester locations they  resorted to making deliveries  themselves so what keeps you guys going  we're very committed  it's tough it's never been a tougher  time but we've been through hard times  before and we're going to get through  this  getting through this means treasuring  the time they've spent together  the family dinners we now have together  every night we've all put on kovaten  but that's been fun that's been very  special actually we all live  very close all over so it's like my  big fat greek wedding yeah that's true  almost yeah the only thing we don't do  we don't do the lamb in the front we do  it in the back  cheers and they sent pictures to prove  it  unfortunately we didn't put it in the  piece but i did bring you gin  oh thank you yeah but apple really uh  yeah  brian took it all brian and tony and  tony bear  yeah yeah i'm sorry you know  this is the one you were texting us your  head brunch there right or lunch it was  we got to do a story right  right right right they're right down the  street yeah good stuff all right

